# From "Free Flow 10" (Wave I - Discovery, CD3-6). This executes the
# one-count waking return after the listener has already learned it. It is
# distinct from return-anchor.gws, which teaches the anchor and explicitly
# leaves the listener in Focus 10, and from return.gws's full ten-to-one count.

@segment   return-one
@title     Ending — Instant Return to Waking
@levels    F10
@fixed
@duration  ~25s

say Return now to full physical waking consciousness by the method you've learned. Think the number one in your mind.
pause 5
say As you do, become completely wide awake, physically and mentally, fully refreshed and filled with new vitality.
pause 5
say Begin your return to full physical waking consciousness. Begin it now.
pause 8
